# shell: desktop
# PVL-069/PVS-030/TS-049: the band has TWO styles and the setting picks
# between them on every frame.  The port drew one solid outline whatever
# the setting said, and the setting had no reader at all.
key 1 ctrl
wait 6
note swept over the empty white below the icons
press 60 200
move 300 260
wait 2
note the edge is tinted harder than the middle, and the middle lets the
note white it covers show through instead of hiding it
expect-pixel 60 230 7f7ff1
expect-pixel 200 230 b7c9da
release 300 260
wait 3
note with transparent selection turned off in the settings
key comma ctrl
wait 5
click 335 205
wait 3
click 432 246
wait 3
key Escape
wait 5
press 60 200
move 300 260
wait 2
note the middle is left alone and the outline is INVERTED -- black on the
note white it is drawn over, and it needs nothing saved underneath
expect-pixel 200 230 ffffff
expect-pixel 60 230 000000
quit
